OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 26 NOV
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GLive from the Chapel of King's
OL,6,     GCollege, London, with music by
OL,7,     GStanford, Coleridge-Taylor and
OL,8,     GElgar.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,10,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,11,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,12,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,13,     GRoach. Today focusing on Max
OL,14,     GRoach as a political force.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GKatie Derham introduces live
OL,17,     Gmusic from pianist Alice Sara
OL,18,     GOtt. Plus, Andras Keller leads
OL,19,     GConcerto Budapest in their most
OL,20,     Grecent tour.
